    "name": "Aegean Cloud",
    "glass": "Lowball",
    "method": "Shaken",
    "description": "The Aegean Cloud is a silky, citrus-forward cocktail that bridges Mediterranean flavors with classic cocktail technique. The unmistakable anise aroma of ouzo forms a striking contrast with the bright sweetness of limoncello and fresh lemon juice, while egg white adds a velvety texture and soft foam. Finished with a light splash of sparkling water, the drink feels airy and refreshing despite its bold flavor profile. Garnished with an orange twist, the Aegean Cloud is both playful and refined—an elegant sour-style cocktail with a distinctly coastal character.",
